    <string name="activation_not_configured_body">The Twilio listening line is still being built. Choose “Offline on this phone” for now, or set the TrustLine number and backend URL in Settings (see backend/README.md).</string>
    <string name="activation_dialer_required">Soteria must be your default phone app to protect calls.</string>
    <string name="activation_permissions_required">Phone permission is required to protect calls.</string>
    <string name="consent_title">Before you turn on protection</string>
    <string name="consent_body">When protection is on, Soteria adds a listening line to your calls:\n\n• Each call is transcribed live by Twilio.\n• The transcript is sent to Soteria\'s server and checked by AI for signs of a scam.\n• Transcripts and risk results are saved in Logs and Alerts on this phone.\n\nIn many places, the law requires the other person to be told that a call is recorded or transcribed. You are responsible for getting their consent.\n\nEmergency calls are never monitored. You can turn protection off at any time.</string>
    <string name="consent_body_offline">When protection is on, Soteria listens to your calls on this phone:\n\n• Calls are put on speaker and transcribed live on the phone. Nothing is sent to the internet.\n• The transcript is checked on the phone for signs of a scam.\n• Transcripts and risk results are saved in Logs and Alerts on this phone.\n\nIn many places, the law requires the other person to be told that a call is recorded or transcribed. You are responsible for getting their consent.\n\nEmergency calls are never monitored. You can turn protection off at any time.</string>
